      "final_status": "translated",
      "source_preview": "The Government of Tanzania, through the Tanzania Ports Authority (TPA), is upgrading the Malindi Wharf at the Port of Dar es Salaam to enhance cargo handling capacity and operational efficiency. As the country's main se…",
      "translated_preview": "坦桑尼亚政府通过坦桑尼亚港务局（TPA），正在升级达累斯萨拉姆港的马林迪码头（Malindi Wharf），以提升货物装卸能力和运营效率。作为该国主要海港以及多个内陆国家的关键区域贸易门户，该港在东非经济中发挥着重要作用。项目包括建设一个多用途泊位及相关支持性基础设施，如进场道路、作业场地、公用设施及改进的港口系统，采用设计施工总承包合同模式，由中国港湾工程有限责任公司承建。",
      "route_path": [
        "block_level",
        "direct_typst"
      ],
      "fallback_to": "",
      "degradation_reason": "",
      "error_types": []
    },
    {
      "item_id": "p003-b003",
      "page_idx": 2,
      "block_idx": 3,
      "block_type": "text",
      "block_kind": "text",
      "layout_role": "paragraph",
      "semantic_role": "body",
      "structure_role": "body",
      "math_mode": "direct_typst",
      "continuation_group": "",
      "classification_label": "",
      "should_translate": true,
      "skip_reason": "",
      "final_status": "translated",
      "source_preview": "Large construction projects pose public health risks, particularly the spread of HIV/AIDS and COVID-19 due to workforce mobility and limited access to health services. Given Tanzania's HIV burden, targeted workplace int…",
      "translated_preview": "大型建设项目会带来公共卫生风险，尤其是由于劳动力流动和卫生服务可及性有限，导致艾滋病和新冠肺炎的传播。鉴于坦桑尼亚的艾滋病负担，有针对性的工作场所干预措施对于保护工人、周边社区以及整体生产力至关重要。",
      "route_path": [
        "block_level",
        "direct_typst"
      ],
      "fallback_to": "",
      "degradation_reason": "",
      "error_types": []
    },
    {
      "item_id": "p003-b004",
