      "classification_label": "",
      "should_translate": true,
      "skip_reason": "",
      "final_status": "translated",
      "source_preview": "In response to these challenges, Vision Care Clinic proposes to implement a comprehensive HIV/AIDS and COVID-19 awareness and prevention programme tailored specifically for personnel engaged in the Malindi Wharf moderni…",
      "translated_preview": "针对这些挑战，Vision Care Clinic 计划为参与 Malindi Wharf 现代化项目的员工实施一项全面的艾滋病与新冠肺炎认知及预防计划。该计划将着重提升认知、推广安全行为、促进检测与咨询服务获取，并加强与治疗和关怀服务的衔接。",
      "route_path": [
        "block_level",
